/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Here in Duval County, we are blessed to have many highly trained and dedicated poll workers, but we need many more to meet our goals ahead of the highly anticipated 2026 gubernatorial election. Poll workers are vital to our operation and simply put, we could not hold elections without them. )
