<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Most of our challenges ahead can be solved by more of you stepping up to join our poll worker force. Those smiling faces you see when going to vote are highly trained, paid and dedicated people who take their jobs seriously to ensure our democracy. If you also share their patriotic call to service, we invite you to contact the Duval County Elections Office to join our team!)
