/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (How to Register to Vote To register to vote, a person must fill out a voter registration application. Voter registration applications are available at the Duval County Supervisor of Elections Office. Applications are also available online at duvalelections.gov, driver license offices, state agencies that provide public assistance, state agencies that serve persons with disabilities, public libraries, and many other public locations. A person may also register to vote online at registertovoteflorida.gov.)
/E (How to Register to Vote To register to vote, a person must fill out a voter registration application. Voter registration applications are available at the Duval County Supervisor of Elections Office. Applications are also available online at duvalelections.gov, driver license offices, state agencies that provide public assistance, state agencies that serve persons with disabilities, public libraries, and many other public locations. A person may also register to vote online at registertovoteflorida.gov.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [9]
>>
