/E (Federal Write-in Absentee Ballot If a military voter absent from Duval County or overseas voter has requested a vote-by-mail ballot and has not received it, such voter may complete and return a Federal Write-in Absentee Ballot \(FWAB\) to the supervisor of elections office by the deadline for any election. The FWAB can be found at www.fvap.gov.  )
