/E (When a Voter Changes Name or Party Affiliation  If a voter changes his or her name by marriage or other legal process, or if a voter wants to change his or her party affiliation, the voter must notify the supervisor of elections office by completing a Florida Voter Registration Application. The voter registration application may be mailed or delivered to the Duval County Supervisor of Elections Office, 105 E. Monroe St., Jacksonville, FL 32202.)
